- Anomalies and their behavior have been reworked;
- Anomaly particles have been improved, anomaly detection mechanics have been reworked;
- The sixteen-story building has been returned to the Forestland;
- The avatar respawn zone on the Radio Tower has been fixed;
- The maximum durability of the "CERBERUS" set has been increased;
- The ability to paint the CA "EXTREME" suit has been fixed;
- The spawn of ghost sorcerers in locations (Forestland, Sorry Lakes, Vesuvius) has been fixed;
- Forestland E6, the appearance has been changed, the avatar spawn zone has been fixed;
- Forestland M4, the avatar respawn zone has been fixed;
- The bonfire at the donation base near the Radio Tower has been fixed;
- A new grenade launcher "FLASH" has been added.

Changes to clans:
- The number of clan members has been set to 50 people;
- Added an item to increase the maximum number of clan members (Military Order - adds 10 slots), the maximum number of upgradeable slots is up to 70 inclusive;
- Added display of information about the number of the clan in the main clan window;
- Added treasury mechanics, now NPCs "Manager" and "Buyer" will live on bases that have been captured by the clan;
- Treasury mechanics allow you to store (things, silver, gold) in a common clan warehouse, the treasury warehouse is available from the NPC "Manager";
- NPC "Buyer" appeared on the bases, the difference from the old NPC is that this buyer accepts purchases from all players, and from sales to the buyer, a percentage of sales goes to the clan treasury (the owner of the base where the buyer is located);
- NPC "Repairman" at the bases now also repairs things, and the clan receives a percentage from this.

- Added a quest line for obtaining the "FLASH" Grenade Launcher;
- Added x8 zinc shells to "FLASH";
- Reworked the percentage of getting Gamma charges;
- Added information about the weight of the item when hovering the cursor over it in the inventory;
- Fixed the spawn zone of avatars on Terra Nova near the plane,
- Returned the exchange for a 4-star Beret;
- Many geometry fixes in all locations;
- Reworked the appearance of the M4 Forestland;
- Reworked the appearance of the "Conductor" location, K2 Forestland;
- Reworked the appearance of the habitat "entrance to the Spiderkhan Cave";
- Fixed the lighting in the Vesuvius location;
- Changed the damage of the RPG-7 / Cranberry / Bulldog;
- Revised the performance characteristics of the "COBRA" machine gun;
- Fixed the experience gained from "Spider of Zarechye", "Bear of Zarechye";
- Returned flame particles for weapon shots;
- The sound of the CW "Storm" muffler has been changed to the regular sound of the A7 muffler;
- The error causing the client to crash during the explosion of a nuclear grenade has been fixed;
- A clan backpack has been added for the "STORM" clan.

Patch fix:
- The error causing server components to crash has been fixed;
- The landscape near the sixteen-story building in the "Forestland" has been fixed;
- The durability of the CERBERUS kit has been fixed;
- The display of the clan's numbers has been fixed after a player has been excluded from the clan;
- NPCs Manager and Buyer have been added to all donation bases.

- New location "Zarechye";
- Changed the spawn period of the boss "Metallurgist";
- Fixed lighting in the location "Vesuvius";
- Fixed character animations (behavior with and without weapons);
- Restored and changed the appearance of the component "PDA";
- Added new types of anomalies "gamma";
- Added new types of artifacts "gamma";
- Added several quest lines in the location "Zarechye";
- Added a new type of guides "Pilot";
- Updated lighting in all locations;
- Fixed lighting inconsistencies on many 3D models;
- Added sound accompaniment for the location "Zarechye";
- Added a new rare item "Palladium";
- Added a new rare item "Slow Twite Heart";
- Added a new base "Shipyard" in the location "Sorry Lakes";
- Adjusted mini-maps (Forestland, Sorry Lakes);
- Changed the allowed destinations where guides can lead for "Gasoline";
- Fixed vegetation type "reed" in the location "Wasteland";
- Changed the angle of the player's camera;
- The item "Piece of Palladium" can be obtained from mutants "Spider", "Metallurgist";
- Added new types of mutants for the location "Zarechye".

Patch fix for version 1.5.4
- Fixed the personal trade window;
- Fixed the color palette for the "PDA";
- Fixed the monologue freezing in the location "Lubetch";
- Fixed the incorrect display of several equipment models;
- Fixed the value of the drawing distance;
- Fixed the sound of SMG "Veresk";
- Added an indication of the character's health and stamina;
- Fixed neutral points of temporary player spawn near the bases (Shipyard, Sanatorium);
- Changed the chance for the "Slow Twite Heart" item appearing to 50%;
- The possibility of exiting the game at the spawn point "Metallurgist" has been blocked;
- The Royal Battle mode has been enabled, the minimum number of participants has been reduced to 6 people;
- Base "Shipyard": the capture interval has been changed on Tuesday, Thursday, Sunday, the capture time is at 21:00;
- Fixed the mini-map for "Sorry Lakes";
- Fixed the radioactive water zone near the pier at the "Sorry Lakes";
- Fixed loading screens for arena locations;
- Fixed a bug due to which it was impossible to put "Palladium" on a seated merchant;
- The guide from the Station (the "Borzhch" bar) now let you to the Market from level 4;
- Added a guide to the "Shipyard" base;
- Fixed gestures ("Push-ups", "Greeting", "Salute");
- Fixed overlapping between the "PDA" depth and the party interface;
- Fixed a bug causing the client to crash during the transition to the "Spiderkhan's Cave" location;
- Changed the sounds of the CW:
-- Weapons of the "СОТНЯ" clan;
-- Weapons of the "Russian_Empire" clan;
-- Suppressor of the "СОТНЯ" clan (180 days);
-- Clan Weapon Suppressor (Model-5, 180 days);
- Fixed a bug during the exchange of "Cerberus" parts.
